;;; EXERCISE

#|
Make a short sketch for 5 different instruments:

1. Create a harmonic scale on c2 upto the 25th overtone.
Quantize the pitches to quartertones.

2. Use any unique 5 pitches for each of the voices.

3. Make the 5 durations for each voice having the same
overall length by using [rnd-sum-to-size]

4. Let all instruments play in p as velocity.
|#

